# What a DEPLOY of this template must not publish (TASK-L183 §4).
#
# nodegx-deploy copies every file that no rule excludes into the public site. Measured
# 2026-09-30: without this file a production build shipped backend/ (the demo world's
# seed and fixtures, the trainer's private labels included), tools/ and hosting/ to
# anyone who asked for them by path.
backend/
tools/
hosting/
# The policy belongs to the backend, which reads it from its own data directory.
nodegx.security.json
